{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonfire Barrage</strong> is a compact roguelike\u00a0inspired by <strong>Seraphs Last Stand,</strong> built around fast 30-minute runs, game-breaking builds, and glorious chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/b76dc16ce073deab893cec4623f1c1b2.poster.avif?t=1767048899\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/b76dc16ce073deab893cec4623f1c1b2.webm?t=1767048899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/b76dc16ce073deab893cec4623f1c1b2.mp4?t=1767048899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Characters</strong>: Choose from 5 characters each with unique base abilities to change the pace of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/9cbd8add8bc177eee65c6b75cb19ffd4.poster.avif?t=1767048899\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/9cbd8add8bc177eee65c6b75cb19ffd4.webm?t=1767048899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/9cbd8add8bc177eee65c6b75cb19ffd4.mp4?t=1767048899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades &amp; Evolution</strong>: Choose from a variety of upgrades during each run, with each one evolving into a more powerful form as you specialize. Choose your upgrades wisely to optimize your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/377ad30cd44d0122f46d44ebbbee3c14.poster.avif?t=1767048899\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/377ad30cd44d0122f46d44ebbbee3c14.webm?t=1767048899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/377ad30cd44d0122f46d44ebbbee3c14.mp4?t=1767048899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Grinding</strong>: Each death resets the game entirely, offering a fresh start with no meta-progression. All tools are available from the beginning\u2014no grinding required\u2014creating a hop-in, hop-out experience for players.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3558240?t=1767048899","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3558240?t=1767048899","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/9722fbbf23b58716b4a3d853f9e504dee05ec80e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767048899","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/9722fbbf23b58716b4a3d853f9e504dee05ec80e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767048899","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonfire Barrage</strong> is a compact roguelike\u00a0inspired by <strong>Seraphs Last Stand,</strong> built around fast 30-minute runs, game-breaking builds, and glorious chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span